        "Description": "Here, there exists a top-of-the-line hospital for the elite and wealthy. Unfortunately, they get their organs and technology in rather... unethical ways. Our intel reveals that this hospital is run by the unsuspecting morticians. ...Smart, yet clever. Your goal is to eliminate them dressed up as Harry Ross; a world-famous motorcyclist who tragically died 2 days ago. Not only would this shut the hospital down, but such a supernatural event would prevent it from reopening. Good luck, Agent 47.",
